<i>And make it a fierce battle</i>

11
00:02:28,667 --> 00:02:31,333
<i>They swing on an elephant's tusk</i>

12
00:02:31,458 --> 00:02:34,542
<i>They are daredevils</i>
<i>With many tricks up their sleeves</i>

13
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:41,583
<i>Who is there to fight back</i>
<i>And keep them from blazing forward?</i>

14
00:02:43,250 --> 00:02:46,125
<i>The festival is off to a grand start</i>
<i>There's euphoria all around</i>

