<i>Those who are hit by them</i>
<i>Will go spinning</i>

896
00:55:21,292 --> 00:55:24,125
<i>They can beat anyone</i>
<i>As excitement builds up</i>

897
00:55:24,250 --> 00:55:27,167
<i>Bring on the rhythm for the celebrations</i>

898
00:55:27,292 --> 00:55:29,750
<i>With the rope in hand</i>
<i>They are standing in line</i>

899
00:55:29,875 --> 00:55:32,583
<i>Who in this world can fight against them?</i>

900
00:55:32,708 --> 00:55:35,500
<i>They are a group that has fought wars</i>
<i>With many tricks and firm steps</i>

901
00:55:35,583 --> 00:55:38,833
<i>They have a leader who knows</i>
<i>How to throw the dice to win</i>

902
00:55:38,917 --> 00:55:44,292
<i>The chest broadens with pride</i>
<i>The iron fists are shining</i>

903
00:55:44,542 --> 00:55:49,833
<i>There's fire in both the eyes</i>

904
00:55:50,333 --> 00:55:53,083
<i>When fury is at its peak</i>
<i>It's a game of fire</i>

905
00:55:53,417 --> 00:55:55,833
<i>Like an out of control weapon</i>

906
00:55:55,958 --> 00:55:59,250
<i>Once angered</i>
<i>He's a mighty male elephant</i>

907
00:56:01,250 --> 00:56:08,208
<i>Sing and dance in joy, my friend</i>

908
00:56:12,750 --> 00:56:19,667
<i>Sing and dance in joy, my friend...</i>

909
00:56:20,708 --> 00:56:25,000
<i>Fourteen veterans who are not ready</i>
<i>to accept defeat are fighting it out</i>

910
00:56:25,500 --> 00:56:26,625
<i>on this battlefield today!</i>

911
00:56:26,958 --> 00:56:31,708
<i>Here! Overthrowing the army</i>
<i>of Sevens Vellukutta,</i>

912
00:56:31,792 --> 00:56:36,125
<i>Winners Pothumukku has emerged victorious!</i>

913
00:56:38,833 --> 00:56:41,208
<i>Team Sevens Vellukuta is being</i>
<i>presented the second prize by</i>

914
00:56:41,333 --> 00:56:44,583
Tolins Tires General Manager
Mr. Abraham Kuruvilla.

915
00:56:44,750 --> 00:56:47,292
At the first position,

916
00:56:47,417 --> 00:56:51,667
the winners of the golden cup
of 51 sovereigns, are none other than

917
00:56:51,958 --> 00:56:55,542
Winners Pothumukku, led by Shaji Pappan!

918
00:57:01,875 --> 00:57:05,500
-We should have won that cup.
-That cup is meant for us, man!

919
00:57:11,792 --> 00:57:18,750
<i>Let's play tug of war,</i>
<i>Win the cup, oh dear</i>

920
00:57:19,000 --> 00:57:24,917
Hey, Cleetus! Don't get too attached
to it. We have to sell it tomorrow.

921
00:57:25,042 --> 00:57:27,125
As soon as we sell it, we should get
the documents back.

922
00:57:27,250 --> 00:57:30,542
And before that Uthup leaves the hospital,
we should start the club's work.

923
00:57:30,667 --> 00:57:31,750
Yes!

924
00:57:32,250 --> 00:57:35,083
-Shajiyetta, kick the brake.
-You're the one who needs to be kicked.

925
00:57:35,250 --> 00:57:38,167
Don't make me mortgage the cup
for the food we eat here.

926
00:57:38,583 --> 00:57:39,583
Get down.

927
00:57:40,417 --> 00:57:42,833
The price of gold is dropping. God!

928
00:57:43,042 --> 00:57:44,792
When we got some gold
after that struggle,

929
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:46,333
here comes the next trouble.

930
00:57:46,583 --> 00:57:48,125
Did this study with you in school, Chetta?

931
00:57:48,250 --> 00:57:50,125
-No.
-It stinks!

932
00:57:50,250 --> 00:57:51,375
-Have it. It's good.
-Chetta!

933
00:57:51,500 --> 00:57:53,208
Can you make this dark?

934
00:57:53,542 --> 00:57:55,208
-Can you make it stronger?
-Yeah.

935
00:57:55,333 --> 00:57:56,958
Hey! Make it stronger.

936
00:57:58,500 --> 00:58:00,500
Is there anything
at least from last week here?

937
00:58:09,750 --> 00:58:13,125
Shajiyetta! Where did he go?
He didn't have the fritters.

938
00:58:14,750 --> 00:58:20,625
Mackerel for 100, sardine for 80,
anchovy for 120.

939
00:58:20,875 --> 00:58:23,083
What do you want, Chetta?
Shall I get you some mackerel?

940
00:58:42,792 --> 00:58:44,042
Shajiyettan!

941
00:58:46,292 --> 00:58:47,542
Are you doing good?

942
00:58:49,458 --> 00:58:50,333
Yes.

943
00:58:52,458 --> 00:58:54,958
-Who are these kids?
-Two at the north are mine.

944
00:58:56,125 --> 00:58:57,833
Two at the south are Ponnappan's.

945
00:59:00,292 --> 00:59:03,708
-And where is he?
-I had a back sprain.

946
00:59:04,208 --> 00:59:05,833
Ponnappan ditched me.

947
00:59:08,125 --> 00:59:11,125
That's good... Mary.

948
00:59:12,125 --> 00:59:14,625
You came into my life
with Christ's mother's name,

949
00:59:15,208 --> 00:59:17,375
and did what Judas' mother would've done!

950
00:59:20,458 --> 00:59:23,000
Anyway, I'm happy
that you're in such a good position.

951
00:59:32,792 --> 00:59:33,875
Mary...

952
00:59:35,333 --> 00:59:37,250
-Shajiyetta.
-Shall I ask you something?

953
00:59:39,167 --> 00:59:40,375
Do you want to come with me?

954
00:59:43,833 --> 00:59:46,125
I'll drop you at the next junction.
You'll get more business there.

955
00:59:52,583 --> 00:59:56,208
SOUP SHOP

956
00:59:56,458 --> 00:59:59,458
Or you needn't go anywhere.
This place is perfect for you.

957
01:00:02,167 --> 01:00:04,083
That was a deadly dialogue, Shajiyetta!

958
01:00:04,208 --> 01:00:05,917
-That was awesome.
-I'm content now, man!

959
01:00:08,792 --> 01:00:10,542
Where the hell are you going?

960
01:00:13,875 --> 01:00:15,875
Shajiyetta, shall I finish him?

961
01:00:17,042 --> 01:00:20,042
Leave it, man. He's some loser.
Get in, boys.

962
01:00:29,625 --> 01:00:30,625
Mom!

963
01:00:33,583 --> 01:00:35,958
-I'll hold that.
-Mom!

964
01:00:37,500 --> 01:00:40,000
Pannimattath Varkey Pappan's wife!

965
01:00:40,833 --> 01:00:46,250
Hey! Rachel! All of you, come out.
Even the neighbors can come.

966
01:00:46,458 --> 01:00:48,750
-Why are you shouting?
-I will shout!

967
01:00:49,500 --> 01:00:53,167
When I asked you to mortgage the documents
for a good deed, what did you say?

968
01:00:53,333 --> 01:00:56,000
That you can't give it.
And you kicked me on my chest!

969
01:00:56,417 --> 01:00:58,250
-So you know what I did?
-What did you do?

970
01:00:58,333 --> 01:01:01,500
-Tell her, boys!
-Shajiyettan stole your documents!

971
01:01:01,708 --> 01:01:05,125
-What?
-I stole your documents!

972
01:01:05,500 --> 01:01:06,750
Jesus!

973
01:01:07,625 --> 01:01:10,792
What did you say that day?
That I am useless, right?

974
01:01:11,000 --> 01:01:12,458
You know what this useless fellow brought?

975
01:01:12,542 --> 01:01:14,292
-What?
-A gold cup of 50 sovereigns!

976
01:01:14,417 --> 01:01:18,042
-A cuppa of 50 sovereigns?
-Not cuppa. A gold cup of 50 sovereigns!

977
01:01:18,417 --> 01:01:21,042
Cleetus, show it to her.
Let her be shocked!

978
01:01:29,250 --> 01:01:31,458
-My documents!
-Mom!

979
01:01:32,125 --> 01:01:33,208
She has fainted!

980
01:01:34,250 --> 01:01:37,458
It's because she saw a gold cup
for the first time! Cover it--

981
01:01:42,583 --> 01:01:44,958
-Gone?
-Where's the cup?

982
01:01:47,042 --> 01:01:49,667
-Where's the cup?
-Where is the cup?

983
01:01:59,917 --> 01:02:02,333
How long has it been since
your wife left you?

984
01:02:02,917 --> 01:02:05,583
-Two years.
-Get up. Go and stand there.

985
01:02:07,625 --> 01:02:10,667
My mom was taken to the ICU,
and not for her first holy mass.

986
01:02:10,792 --> 01:02:13,708
-Who drew this picture?
-Who will it be?

987
01:02:14,083 --> 01:02:16,500
Cleetus, just try and remember.

988
01:02:16,625 --> 01:02:18,458
Who did you give it to
when you lost your memory?

989
01:02:18,583 --> 01:02:21,542
Why can't you understand?
I wasn't in that vehicle, Pappan!

990
01:02:21,708 --> 01:02:23,167
-And not--
-Tell me the truth, Cleetus.

991
01:02:23,250 --> 01:02:24,333
Where did you go and sell it?

992
01:02:33,875 --> 01:02:37,458
Hey! I've seen the driver
who was about to hit us.

993
01:02:38,042 --> 01:02:41,250
-Really? Where?
-Who is that driver?

994
01:02:42,333 --> 01:02:44,667
-How do you do that?
-Hey.

995
01:02:44,833 --> 01:02:46,917
-Who's here for Mariyamma?
-It's me. Why?

996
01:02:47,125 --> 01:02:48,833
Those who want to see her can see her now.

997
01:02:59,292 --> 01:03:02,417
How do I go and face that hag?

998
01:03:03,167 --> 01:03:06,583
Pappan, consider that your mom's
time has come.

999
01:03:07,000 --> 01:03:11,083
Go. Go and see her, Pappan.
Mom's soul will always be with you.

1000
01:03:12,208 --> 01:03:15,458
You needn't know anything. I will make
all the arrangements for the funeral.

1001
01:03:16,500 --> 01:03:18,125
She has made tea for you
plenty of times, right?

1002
01:03:18,250 --> 01:03:21,208
-Pappan!
-She's gone, dear.

1003
01:03:22,125 --> 01:03:23,125
Are you sad?

1004
01:03:26,958 --> 01:03:29,667
-Don't cry.
-It's not that. The money for the funeral?

1005
01:03:29,750 --> 01:03:32,667
-God!
-Hey! Don't get a wreath.

1006
01:03:33,042 --> 01:03:34,333
That's out of fashion.

1007
01:03:34,458 --> 01:03:35,708
-What else is there?
-Band set?

1008
01:03:36,000 --> 01:03:39,542
Okay. Arrange an ambulance.
Call one right now.

1009
01:03:40,458 --> 01:03:44,250
And I have to inform Sachin.
That's enough.

1010
01:03:52,208 --> 01:03:56,458
Even though we used to argue and fight...
she loved me a lot.

1011
01:03:58,583 --> 01:04:01,792
-Did she say anything before departing?
-Departing where?

1012
01:04:02,125 --> 01:04:04,542
From the time she regained consciousness,
she's been lying there upset,

1013
01:04:04,667 --> 01:04:06,708
saying that she doesn't want to see
some loser, Shaji.

1014
01:04:06,792 --> 01:04:08,542
But it's our duty to inform you, right?

1015
01:04:09,250 --> 01:04:12,375
-Lying there upset? She didn't die!
-Nonsense!

1016
01:04:13,792 --> 01:04:15,000
You didn't die?

1017
01:04:16,667 --> 01:04:20,333
-Mom is saying something, Pappan.
-Is it some last wish?

1018
01:04:21,667 --> 01:04:23,750
-What is it, Mom?
-I will kill you!

1019
01:04:24,000 --> 01:04:25,375
This was to stop her from swearing?

1020
01:04:25,750 --> 01:04:29,000
-Shajiyetta! Hey!
-What is it?

1021
01:04:29,792 --> 01:04:32,750
I've arranged an AC ambulance to take
Mom's body. Shall we take the body?

1022
01:04:32,875 --> 01:04:34,542
-You take it.
-You hold the back side.

1023
01:04:34,625 --> 01:04:36,875
Okay. He will be a dead body now.

1024
01:04:42,333 --> 01:04:45,542
Fifteen-thousand-five-hundred
in just a day! Most from the canteen.

1025
01:04:46,208 --> 01:04:49,000
I lost the cup, my house, and now,
I think I'll lose my mom too!

1026
01:04:49,833 --> 01:04:53,000
She's saying that she won't step out
of the ICU unless I return the documents.

1027
01:04:53,125 --> 01:04:54,667
-It's very cold there, it seems.
-Is that so?

1028
01:04:54,792 --> 01:04:58,167
Then we'll do something. The mortuary
is right next to the ICU, right?

1029
01:04:58,250 --> 01:04:59,292
Let's move her there.

1030
01:04:59,417 --> 01:05:01,042
There it's really cold
and much cheaper too.

1031
01:05:01,167 --> 01:05:03,000
-You bloody--
-Hey, Lolan, catch him!

1032
01:05:03,125 --> 01:05:04,708
I won't!

1033
01:05:06,042 --> 01:05:07,958
-Will all of you kill me?
-Abu, hold him.

1034
01:05:08,083 --> 01:05:10,792
Shajiyetta, you can apply that medicine
from Rajasthan!

1035
01:05:11,208 --> 01:05:14,250
-You and your damn medicine!
-Shajiyetta, got it.

1036
01:05:15,958 --> 01:05:17,875
Shajiyetta! Your doubts were right.

1037
01:05:17,958 --> 01:05:20,042
-We found them.
-His name is Anali Sabu.

1038
01:05:20,208 --> 01:05:22,542
The younger brother of Satan Lassar,
who died in a bomb blast.

1039
01:05:22,667 --> 01:05:24,750
I'm sure he's the one who stole our cup.

1040
01:05:25,667 --> 01:05:27,958
But we shouldn't take them lightly.

1041
01:05:28,208 --> 01:05:30,208
<i>They run an illegal dance bar</i>
<i>at Perumbavoor border</i>

1042
01:05:30,375 --> 01:05:31,958
<i>under the guise of a rubber factory.</i>

1043
01:05:32,083 --> 01:05:35,000
<i>-We might not be able to clash with them!</i>
-Then come on, Shajiyetta!

1044
01:05:43,500 --> 01:05:46,458
-Lolan, get the stuff!
-Right away, Shajiyetta!

1045
01:05:54,500 --> 01:05:56,792
I will finish them today!

