1050
01:06:53,792 --> 01:06:55,625
<i>My dear</i>
<i>My darling</i>

1051
01:06:55,708 --> 01:06:57,583
<i>My doe eyed beauty</i>

1052
01:06:57,667 --> 01:07:01,292
<i>Don't come and whisper</i>
<i>Sweet nothings to me</i>

1053
01:07:01,458 --> 01:07:08,417
<i>Don't we have enough and more to talk</i>
<i>Until we get tired?</i>

1054
01:07:10,625 --> 01:07:17,542
<i>This body of mine is electrified</i>
<i>Come to me, my dear</i>

1055
01:07:18,333 --> 01:07:25,292
<i>Like a matchstick, like an electric wire</i>
<i>Extinguish the fire in my heart</i>

1056
